          "title": "Rooky",
          "subtitle": "Card Game",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Rooky is a Rummy-like game using a proprietary Rook deck, with meld building, discarding, and some Rook-style team elements."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Rooky is documented as a distinct commercial card-game publication with its own player count, equipment, and objective."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Setup",
          "subtitle": "Table, deck, equipment, and deal",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "2-5 players use the table arrangement described for Rooky."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "A proprietary Rook deck with numbered color cards and the Rook bird card, used for Rooky meld and discard play."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Rook deck, score area, and enough table space for play."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Prepare Rook deck and deal or lay out cards according to the documented Rooky rules before play begins."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
